# r2
===
 Free open-source Cloudflare R2 desktop client and S3 GUI for macOS, Windows, and Linux. Manage Cloudflare R2, AWS S3, MinIO, and RustFS buckets with multi-account support — and mount any bucket as a local drive. Built with Tauri, Next.js, and React.
